<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Krishv Digital Grow Lab | Digital Marketing Agency</title>
<meta name="description" content="Krishv Digital Grow Lab helps businesses grow with Social Media Marketing, Meta Ads, Google Ads, Lead Generation, WhatsApp Marketing, Branding & AI-powered solutions." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#07070b;
    --bg-2:#0e0e16;
    --card:#12121c;
    --card-2:#171724;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    --text:#eaeaf2;
    --muted:#9a9ab0;
    --accent:#FFC107;
    --accent-2:#FFFFFF;
    --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFC107 0%,#FFFFFF 100%);
    --radius:18px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.65;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;line-height:1.15;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block}
  .container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}

  .glow{position:fixed;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(120px);opacity:.28;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
  .glow.g1{width:520px;height:520px;background:#FFC107;top:-200px;left:-160px}
  .glow.g2{width:560px;height:560px;background:#FFFFFF;top:400px;right:-220px}
  .glow.g3{width:420px;height:420px;background:#FFC107;bottom:-180px;left:30%}

  header{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
    backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
    background:rgba(7,7,11,.72);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 22px;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .brand-logo { height: 55px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; }
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center}
  .nav-links a{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;transition:.25s}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
    padding:13px 24px;border-radius:100px;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;
    transition:.28s;cursor:pointer;border:none;font-family:'Inter';
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--grad);color:#07070b;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(255,193,7,.25)}
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(255,193,7,.4)}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
  .menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:none;color:var(--text);font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}

  .hero{position:relative;padding:100px 0 90px;z-index:1}
  .hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
  .badge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    padding:8px 16px;border-radius:100px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;
    background:rgba(255,193,7,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.25);
    color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:24px;
  }
  .badge .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,5.2vw,60px);margin-bottom:22px}
  .hero h1 .grad{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
  .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:17.5px;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}
  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:44px}
  .stats{display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .stat h3{font-size:30px;background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}
  .stat p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

  .hero-card{
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--card-2),var(--card));
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:26px;padding:26px;
    box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero-card::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:26px;
    background:var(--grad);opacity:.14;z-index:-1;filter:blur(24px);
  }
  .hc-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .hc-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .hc-icon{
    width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;flex-shrink:0;
    background:rgba(255,193,7,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.22);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;
  }
  .hc-row div p:first-child{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600}
  .hc-row div p:last-child{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .hc-bar{height:6px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);margin-top:6px;overflow:hidden}
  .hc-bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--grad);border-radius:100px}

  section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:90px 0}
  .sec-head{text-align:center;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto 58px}
  .sec-tag{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,42px);margin-bottom:16px}
  .sec-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16.5px}

  .services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
  .svc{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:30px 26px;transition:.32s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .svc::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;
    background:var(--grad);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:.4s;
  }
  .svc:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(255,193,7,.3);background:var(--card-2)}
  .svc:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
  .svc-icon{
    width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;
    font-size:22px;margin-bottom:20px;background:var(--grad);color:#07070b;
  }
  .svc h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .svc p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted)}

  .about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
  .ceo-card{
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--card-2),var(--card));
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:34px;text-align:center;
  }
  .ceo-avatar{
    width:110px;height:110px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 20px;
    background:var(--grad);display:grid;place-items:center;
    font-size:42px;font-weight:700;color:#07070b;font-family:'Space Grotesk';
  }
  .ceo-card h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:5px}
  .ceo-card .role{font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:18px}
  .ceo-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .about-text h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin-bottom:22px}
  .about-text p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px;font-size:16px}
  .about-list{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}
  .about-list li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:15px}
  .about-list li::before{
    content:'✓';flex-shrink:0;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(255,193,7,.12);color:var(--accent);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;
  }

  .process-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}
  .step{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:28px 24px;position:relative;transition:.3s;
  }
  .step:hover{border-color:rgba(255,193,7,.35);transform:translateY(-4px)}
  .step-num{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-size:42px;font-weight:700;
    background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;opacity:.65;margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .step h3{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:9px}
  .step p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}

  .cta-wrap{
    background:linear-gradient(140deg,rgba(255,193,7,.1),rgba(255,255,255,.1));
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:60px 50px;
    text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cta-wrap h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,42px);margin-bottom:16px}
  .cta-wrap p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 32px;font-size:16.5px}
  .cta-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}

  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}
  .contact-info h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin-bottom:18px}
  .contact-info > p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:32px;font-size:16px}
  .ci-item{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}
  .ci-icon{
    width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;flex-shrink:0;
    background:rgba(255,193,7,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.22);
    display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:19px;
  }
  .ci-item p:first-child{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .ci-item p:last-child{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}

  form{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:34px;
  }
  .field{margin-bottom:18px}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--muted)}
  .field input,.field select,.field textarea{
    width:100%;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--bg-2);border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--text);font-family:'Inter';font-size:14.5px;
    transition:.25s;outline:none;
  }
  .field input:focus,.field select:focus,.field textarea:focus{
    border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,193,7,.12);
  }
  .field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:100px}
  form .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:8px}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:50px 0 30px;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-bottom:40px}
  .footer-grid p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;max-width:320px}
  .footer-col h4{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .footer-col a{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;transition:.2s}
  .footer-col a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
  .footer-bottom{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);
  }

  .wa-float{
    position:fixed;bottom:26px;right:26px;z-index:200;
    width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;background:#25D366;
    display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.4);
    transition:.28s;
  }
  .wa-float:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}
  .wa-float svg{width:30px;height:30px;fill:#fff}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:.7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  @media(max-width:960px){
    .hero-inner,.about-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}
    .services-grid,.process-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .hero{padding:70px 0 60px}
    section{padding:70px 0}
  }
  @media(max-width:640px){
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .menu-btn{display:block}
    .nav-links.open{
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;right:0;
      background:var(--bg-2);padding:24px;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav-links.open .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center}
    .services-grid,.process-grid,.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .cta-wrap{padding:44px 24px}
    .stats{gap:26px}
    .stat h3{font-size:24px}
    form{padding:24px}
    .hero-card{padding:20px}
    .brand-logo { height: 40px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="glow g1"></div>
<div class="glow g2"></div>
<div class="glow g3"></div>

<!-- ================= HEADER ================= -->
<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home" class="logo">
      <!-- UNGA LOGO INGA ADD PANNIRUKEN -->
      <img src="logo.png" alt="Krishv Digital Grow Lab Logo" class="brand-logo" />
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/919345756009?text=Hi%20Krishv%20Digital%20Grow%20Lab%2C%20I%20want%20a%20free%20audit" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Free Audit →</a>
    </div>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn">☰</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span> Digital Marketing Agency</div>
      <h1>Grow Your Brand. <span class="grad">Grow Your Future.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        We help businesses, entrepreneurs and personal brands grow through practical
        digital marketing strategies — from content and ads to leads and conversions.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="https://wa.me/919345756009?text=Hi%20Krishv%20Digital%20Grow%20Lab%2C%20I%20want%20to%20grow%20my%20business" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Talk on WhatsApp →</a>
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">View Services</a>
      </div>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><h3>9+</h3><p>Growth Services</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3>100%</h3><p>Result Focused</p></div>
        <div class="stat"><h3>24/7</h3><p>Support</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card reveal">
      <div class="hc-row">
        <div class="hc-icon">📈</div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <p>Instagram Reach</p>
          <div class="hc-bar"><span style="width:88%"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-row">
        <div class="hc-icon">🎯</div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <p>Meta Ads Leads</p>
          <div class="hc-bar"><span style="width:76%"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-row">
        <div class="hc-icon">🔍</div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <p>Google Ranking</p>
          <div class="hc-bar"><span style="width:64%"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-row">
        <div class="hc-icon">💬</div>
        <div style="flex:1">
          <p>WhatsApp Enquiries</p>
          <div class="hc-bar"><span style="width:92%"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= SERVICES ================= -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-tag">What We Do</div>
      <h2>Services That Drive Real Growth</h2>
      <p>Everything your business needs to attract the right audience, generate enquiries and turn digital platforms into revenue.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">📱</div>
        <h3>Instagram Marketing</h3>
        <p>Reels strategy, content planning and profile optimisation to grow reach and convert followers into customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">📘</div>
        <h3>Facebook Ads</h3>
        <p>Targeted Meta ad campaigns built to generate quality leads at the lowest possible cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Google Ads</h3>
        <p>Search, display and local ads that put your business in front of people actively searching for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">💻</div>
        <h3>Website Design</h3>
        <p>Fast, mobile-friendly and conversion-focused websites that turn visitors into enquiries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>SEO</h3>
        <p>On-page, off-page and local SEO to help your business rank higher and get found organically.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">🎬</div>
        <h3>Content Creation / Reels</h3>
        <p>Scroll-stopping reels, creatives and content strategy designed around what actually works.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>Branding / Logo Design</h3>
        <p>Build a memorable brand identity with professional logos, visuals and brand guidelines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">💬</div>
        <h3>WhatsApp Marketing</h3>
        <p>Bulk campaigns, automation and follow-up systems that turn chats into paying customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc reveal">
        <div class="svc-icon">📧</div>
        <h3>Email Marketing</h3>
        <p>Email funnels and campaigns that nurture your audience and bring repeat business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="ceo-card reveal">
      <div class="ceo-avatar">LR</div>
      <h3>Latheesh R</h3>
      <div class="role">CEO & Founder</div>
      <p>Krishv Digital Grow Lab</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <div class="sec-tag">About Us</div>
      <h2>We Turn Digital Platforms Into Real Business Growth</h2>
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Latheesh R</strong>, CEO of Krishv Digital Grow Lab. 🚀 We help businesses,
        entrepreneurs and personal brands grow through practical digital marketing strategies.
      </p>
      <p>
        We provide Social Media Marketing, Content Strategy, Meta Ads, Google Ads, Lead Generation,
        WhatsApp Marketing, Branding and AI-powered solutions. Along with services, we share
        practical marketing advice to help businesses understand what works, attract the right
        audience, generate enquiries and turn digital platforms into real business growth. 📈
      </p>
      <ul class="about-list">
        <li>Strategy-first approach — no random posting</li>
        <li>Data-driven campaigns focused on leads, not likes</li>
        <li>Transparent reporting and clear communication</li>
        <li>AI-powered tools for faster, smarter execution</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= PROCESS ================= -->
<section id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="sec-tag">How We Work</div>
      <h2>Our 4-Step Growth Process</h2>
      <p>A simple, proven system that takes your business from invisible to in-demand.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-grid">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Discover</h3>
        <p>We understand your business, audience and goals to build the right strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Plan</h3>
        <p>Content, ads and funnel strategy mapped out for maximum reach and conversions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Execute</h3>
        <p>We create, publish and run campaigns — consistently and professionally.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <h3>Optimise</h3>
        <p>Track results, refine what works and scale the growth month after month.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= CTA ================= -->
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-wrap reveal">
      <h2>Ready to Grow Your Business?</h2>
      <p>Get a free audit of your Instagram, website or ad account. We'll show you exactly what's holding you back — and how to fix it.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://wa.me/919345756009?text=Hi%2C%20I%20want%20a%20FREE%20audit%20for%20my%20business" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Get Free Audit →</a>
        <a href="tel:+919345756009" class="btn btn-ghost">📞 Call Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= CONTACT ================= -->
<section id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-info reveal">
      <div class="sec-tag">Get In Touch</div>
      <h2>Let's Build Your Growth Plan</h2>
      <p>Have a question or ready to start? Reach out on WhatsApp, call us, or fill the form — we usually reply within a few hours.</p>

      <div class="ci-item">
        <div class="ci-icon">📞</div>
        <div>
          <p>Phone / WhatsApp</p>
          <p><a href="tel:+919345756009">+91 93457 56009</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ci-item">
        <div class="ci-icon">💬</div>
        <div>
